{"4595150": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "EDEN SALVAGE", "steam_appid": 4595150, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4595150/extras/c7ba33c5ba0d22f50ace25832376da25.avif?t=1780646919\" width=600 height=245 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Travel. Collect artifacts. Reach Eden</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4595150/extras/9cb0a109f9db64a45e800e1245e2ab6c.poster.avif?t=1780646919\" width=600 height=84 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4595150/extras/9cb0a109f9db64a45e800e1245e2ab6c.webm?t=1780646919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4595150/extras/9cb0a109f9db64a45e800e1245e2ab6c.mp4?t=1780646919\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4595150/extras/35b0c3825e1418b6f651c67dfc1efbfa.poster.avif?t=1780646919\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4595150/extras/35b0c3825e1418b6f651c67dfc1efbfa.webm?t=1780646919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4595150/extras/35b0c3825e1418b6f651c67dfc1efbfa.mp4?t=1780646919\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No one knows what they truly are.<br>But there are always buyers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a salvager, navigating waterways in a specialized vehicle.<br>Dive. Recover. Sell. A rough-edged partner riding shotgun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Earn one million Eden Coins.</strong><br>Enough to leave this land behind, when the journey ends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4595150/extras/44c2986108ebb050b36c231541f0ced2.poster.avif?t=1780646919\" width=600 height=84 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4595150/extras/44c2986108ebb050b36c231541f0ced2.webm?t=1780646919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4595150/extras/44c2986108ebb050b36c231541f0ced2.mp4?t=1780646919\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Some artifacts carry properties unlike anything of this world.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4595150/extras/52a68aa30133641e2338ffa7136f063d.poster.avif?t=1780646919\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4595150/extras/52a68aa30133641e2338ffa7136f063d.webm?t=1780646919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4595150/extras/52a68aa30133641e2338ffa7136f063d.mp4?t=1780646919\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Sell them, or wield them.</strong></i><br>From simple weapons to ultimate relics that bend the laws of reality —<br>the artifacts you gather give the journey its color.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Earn a million coins, and you can finally leave.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Three scenes weave a single journey.</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4595150/extras/c534f801ca653758c670835dc05d455f.poster.avif?t=1780646919\" width=600 height=84 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4595150/extras/c534f801ca653758c670835dc05d455f.webm?t=1780646919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4595150/extras/c534f801ca653758c670835dc05d455f.mp4?t=1780646919\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drive the endless road</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4595150/extras/74be05ee9060c707d2124b171a25edea.poster.avif?t=1780646919\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4595150/extras/74be05ee9060c707d2124b171a25edea.webm?t=1780646919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4595150/extras/74be05ee9060c707d2124b171a25edea.mp4?t=1780646919\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cracked highways. Snowfields. Forgotten forests.<br>Time, weather, and strange structures shift their shape with every drive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4595150/extras/87c8395d7be1e3bf8910bc89702a0a84.poster.avif?t=1780646919\" width=600 height=84 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4595150/extras/87c8395d7be1e3bf8910bc89702a0a84.webm?t=1780646919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4595150/extras/87c8395d7be1e3bf8910bc89702a0a84.mp4?t=1780646919\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Descend into deep water</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4595150/extras/ba07f3fa8a3b71e8a86f68a275fa93c0.poster.avif?t=1780646919\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4595150/extras/ba07f3fa8a3b71e8a86f68a275fa93c0.webm?t=1780646919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4595150/extras/ba07f3fa8a3b71e8a86f68a275fa93c0.mp4?t=1780646919\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depth. Noise. Damage —<br>Three numbers hunting you down. Choose what's worth bringing back to the surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4595150/extras/7878cf3cc20ada9c29ba18520c71c974.poster.avif?t=1780646919\" width=600 height=84 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4595150/extras/7878cf3cc20ada9c29ba18520c71c974.webm?t=1780646919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4595150/extras/7878cf3cc20ada9c29ba18520c71c974.mp4?t=1780646919\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Walk the earth</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4595150/extras/14f77205cf8bf9f4ce0f275f3edfbccf.poster.avif?t=1780646919\" width=