991ff7aa66609dd5081.mp4?t=1780646919\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And if you fail to earn enough —</strong></p>", "short_description": "Journey across a strange, post-apocalyptic world. Salvage relics from the deep. Earn 1,000,000 coins and leave this place. 21 days left —", "supported_languages": "English, Japanese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4595150/b7cfc7ea3b25060ab28b85112aec0d378fee4b96/header.jpg?t=1780646919", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4595150/28f4cdd3239583dc7793d63c816655bf10b39418/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1780646919", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4595150/28f4cdd3239583dc7793d63c816655bf10b39418/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1780646919", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 (8th generation or later)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050 Ti<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX compatible<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> System requirements are subject to change during development.</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Detritus Works"], "publishers": ["Detritus Works"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 22, "description": "Steam Achievements"}, {"id": 68, "description": "Custom Volume Controls"}, {"id": 74, "description": "Playable without Timed Input"}, {"id": 79, "description": "Save Anytime"}, {"id": 69, "description": "Stereo Sound"}, {"id": 